Because you always said that.

507
00:20:09.243 --> 00:20:10.243
[sigh]

508
00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.177
This time too

509
00:20:11.877 --> 00:20:12.779
It's a lump

510
00:20:12.846 --> 00:20:15.114
I barely, barely managed to trick you and bring you here.

511
00:20:16.984 --> 00:20:20.086
This is the only way to do surgery

512
00:20:20.153 --> 00:20:23.489
Oh, I will take responsibility after the surgery.
I'll tell you everything

513
00:20:27.901 --> 00:20:29.406
[Calm music]

514
00:20:29.473 --> 00:20:31.564
(Jaehwi) Grandmother of Nokdujeon in Pyeongnam Market

515
00:20:32.067 --> 00:20:32.999
(Namkyung) Yes?

516
00:20:33.534 --> 00:20:34.967
(Jaehwi) Just now, don’t you know?

517
00:20:35.634 --> 00:20:38.105
Money is not for old people like you.

518
00:20:38.172 --> 00:20:40.440
It should be used for children who will live for a long time in the future.

519
00:20:40.507 --> 00:20:43.267
Every year in the pediatric department of our hospital
You donate 100 million won each.

520
00:20:43.334 --> 00:20:44.945
Did you appear on You Quiz too?

521
00:20:45.012 --> 00:20:46.400
(Nanjing) Ah

522
00:20:46.467 --> 00:20:48.834
So, the hospital director earlier said
You came to say hello.

523
00:20:48.901 --> 00:20:49.983
(Jaehwi) Yes, yes, yes

524
00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.100
He is a person who does a lot of good things.

525
00:20:52.167 --> 00:20:53.400
[Jaehwi takes a deep breath]

526
00:20:53.467 --> 00:20:56.255
Wait a minute, wait a minute, um...

527
00:20:57.501 --> 00:21:00.159
I think it's a small reward for that.

528
00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.119
Let's all wear it together

529
00:21:03.186 --> 00:21:04.249
Let's be careful

530
00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.365
Well, it might be a bit of a hassle, but

531
00:21:07.234 --> 00:21:08.260
(Nanjing, Gion) Yes

532
00:21:09.834 --> 00:21:10.834
Everyone is home from work now, right?

533
00:21:10.901 --> 00:21:11.966
If it's okay, we'll have dinner together...

534
00:21:12.033 --> 00:21:13.213
- (Namkyung) I have a promise...
- (Gion) Okay, professor.

535
00:21:16.977 --> 00:21:17.943
[Embarrassed laughter]

536
00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:20.642
It's okay, it's okay

537
00:21:20.709 --> 00:21:22.381
(Jaehwi) Why are you like this? Take it easy, take it easy

538
00:21:22.448 --> 00:21:24.033
[light laughter]
yes

539
00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:25.051
Let's go

540
00:21:25.734 --> 00:21:28.254
Enjoy your dinner

541
00:21:28.934 --> 00:21:31.100
(Namkyung) Ah, ah, ah, yes
[Jaehwi’s light smile]

542
00:21:31.167 --> 00:21:32.933
Professor, enjoy your meal too.

543
00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.026
(Jaehwi) Yes

544
00:21:40.332 --> 00:21:41.433
(Dowon) Raw back ribs

545
00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:43.904
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

546
00:21:43.971 --> 00:21:45.104
Seasoned ribs

547
00:21:47.007 --> 00:21:48.174
Whole pork belly!

548
00:21:49.753 --> 00:21:51.077
eat a lot

549
00:21:51.144 --> 00:21:53.480
Everyone catches me when I’m not on duty.
I really had a hard time

550
00:21:53.547 --> 00:21:55.114
(Together) Let’s eat well!

551
00:22:00.254 --> 00:22:01.233
(Japan) Teacher

552
00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:03.100
Emergency Medicine
Are you close with teacher Park Jun-seok?

553
00:22:03.167 --> 00:22:04.090
Just what

554
00:22:04.791 --> 00:22:06.026
(Jae-il) Can you say something?

555
00:22:06.093 --> 00:22:09.161
Because of that real emergency medicine department.
I think I'm going to lose hair due to stress.

556
00:22:09.796 --> 00:22:11.200
no

557
00:22:11.267 --> 00:22:12.866
When a female patient says she has a stomachache

558
00:22:12.933 --> 00:22:14.767
I call the gynecologist without even looking at it properly.

559
00:22:15.536 --> 00:22:17.336
Why are you calling us if you have cholecystitis?

560
00:22:19.042 --> 00:22:20.540
(Dowon) Is there something you want me to see?

561
00:22:20.607 --> 00:22:21.707
(Jae-il) Mmm!

562
00:22:22.567 --> 00:22:25.133
That's not it, we called.

563
00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:27.047
Anyone, please come quickly and take the patient.

564
00:22:27.114 --> 00:22:30.383
Ugh, so people
They make fun of me because it’s a call center

565
00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:31.685
Please scold the pediatrician too.

566
00:22:31.752 --> 00:22:33.653
Why am I scolding them?

567
00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:35.367
[Bright Music - Continued]
If I call you quickly, you’ll pout and say I called you early.

568
00:22:35.434 --> 00:22:37.233
(Sabi) If you call me late
He complained that I called him late

569
00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:39.133
Even things like this make me very angry.

570
00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:42.018
I think it’s a pediatrician.
Because I’m very micro inside.

571
00:22:42.085 --> 00:22:43.734
There are many kids like that.

572
00:22:43.801 --> 00:22:44.933
There can't be many.

573
00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.632
There is no one in the pediatrics department.

574
00:22:47.835 --> 00:22:49.267
(Lee Young) Hey, what is the anesthesiology department like?

575
00:22:49.334 --> 00:22:51.267
There are so many people at my bedside.
I know you're the boss

576
00:22:51.334 --> 00:22:52.538
Coach driver is no joke

577
00:22:53.173 --> 00:22:54.907
No, the operating room is Centipede's?

578
00:22:56.109 --> 00:22:57.783
(Dowon) What about obstetrics and gynecology?

579
00:22:58.612 --> 00:23:00.980
I always push my way into the operating room with a stage gun.

580
00:23:01.481 --> 00:23:03.500
Threaten me with a baby and tell me to come and go

581
00:23:03.567 --> 00:23:05.933
So everyone looks at us
They make fun of me and call me a gangster.

582
00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:07.687
They really hate us too

583
00:23:07.754 --> 00:23:10.133
And anyway, they
You don't have to ask us anything

584
00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:12.357
Even if we fight, only we who always ask for it will lose.

585
00:23:12.424 --> 00:23:15.027
So, get along well, get along well.

586
00:23:16.496 --> 00:23:17.663
[Jaeil’s sigh]

587
00:23:21.068 --> 00:23:23.336
Let’s eat today
Don't talk about the hospital while eating.

588
00:23:23.403 --> 00:23:24.658
(together) yes

589
00:23:31.142 --> 00:23:32.212
(Jae-il) Ah, I’m full.

590
00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:34.747
Wow, I'm full.

591
00:23:35.382 --> 00:23:36.667
We ate well (together)

592
00:23:36.734 --> 00:23:37.634
(Lee Young) I ate well.

593
00:23:37.701 --> 00:23:39.386
- (Dowon) See you tomorrow
- (Japan) Please go in.

594
00:23:39.453 --> 00:23:40.387
(Namkyung) See you tomorrow!

595
00:23:40.454 --> 00:23:41.554
- (Japan) Please enter carefully.
- (Sabi) Let’s go.

596
00:23:46.923 --> 00:23:48.028
(Japan) Go

597
00:23:48.095 --> 00:23:49.028
(Nanjing)

598
00:23:50.996 --> 00:23:52.198
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

599
00:23:56.801 --> 00:23:57.636
(Lee Young) Huh?

600
00:23:58.305 --> 00:23:59.710
Weren’t you going to the hospital again?

601
00:24:00.340 --> 00:24:01.716
(Dowon) No, are you going to go home?

602
00:24:02.501 --> 00:24:03.709
(Lee Young) But why did you go there?

603
00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:06.612
(Dowon) Yes?
[lively music]

604
00:24:07.981 --> 00:24:09.300
Ah! I...

605
00:24:09.367 --> 00:24:10.449
I thought the house was over there

606
00:24:14.901 --> 00:24:16.123
(Lee Young) Ah

607
00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:18.290
Do you think the kids will misunderstand it?

608
00:24:19.259 --> 00:24:21.227
I guess it's just that the houses are facing the same direction.

609
00:24:21.895 --> 00:24:24.397
They don't care about others as much as you think.

610
00:24:24.464 --> 00:24:25.432
[Dowon snorts]

611
00:24:25.499 --> 00:24:28.000
(Dowon) What I told you to never say
Who is it?

612
00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:29.902
(Lee Young) Is that so?

613
00:24:31.367 --> 00:24:33.706
(Dowon) But leave the main road behind
Why do you go to places like this?

614
00:24:34.208 --> 00:24:35.541
(Lee Young) It’s the fastest way to go here.

615
00:24:36.844 --> 00:24:38.577
(Dowon) It’s so dark in here

616
00:24:39.246 --> 00:24:40.779
Not many people go around at night

617
00:24:41.701 --> 00:24:43.282
I think it would be a bit dangerous to go alone, right?

618
00:24:52.159 --> 00:24:53.091
no

619
00:24:53.158 --> 00:24:55.467
And if you meet a strange person
What are you trying to do?

620
00:24:55.534 --> 00:24:57.062
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

621
00:24:59.644 --> 00:25:00.833
Let's throw a bamboo stick

622
00:25:01.567 --> 00:25:02.867
(Lee Young) I also throw away my earplugs

623
00:25:02.934 --> 00:25:04.003
[bursts of laughter]

624
00:25:06.139 --> 00:25:07.707
He's a gangster

625
00:25:07.774 --> 00:25:08.896
He's a gangster

626
00:25:16.583 --> 00:25:17.984
Well, in high school

627
00:25:18.051 --> 00:25:19.667
Did you just do something like boxing?

628
00:25:19.734 --> 00:25:20.753
(Lee Young) What do you mean?

629
00:25:21.321 --> 00:25:22.823
(Dowon) There is a rumor that he is good at playing.

630
00:25:22.890 --> 00:25:23.956
[Lee Young’s absurd laughter]

631
00:25:24.023 --> 00:25:25.157
(Lee Young) What do you say?

632
00:25:26.760 --> 00:25:28.760
[Interesting music]

633
00:25:30.230 --> 00:25:31.200
[Monk’s sigh]

634
00:25:31.267 --> 00:25:32.100
[Jooyoung’s satisfied moans]
[Seungwon’s happy laughter]

635
00:25:32.167 --> 00:25:33.465
(Seungwon) Is it that delicious?

636
00:25:33.532 --> 00:25:34.500
(Jooyoung) Yes

637
00:25:35.034 --> 00:25:36.734
I think this restaurant is really the best for crab.

638
00:25:36.801 --> 00:25:38.200
I'll buy more next time

639
00:25:38.267 --> 00:25:40.405
I left too late
There were only two left

640
00:25:40.472 --> 00:25:41.544
(Jooyoung) Hmm

641
00:25:41.611 --> 00:25:43.544
I want to take care of myself

642
00:25:43.611 --> 00:25:45.567
Last time I collected eggs, I saw

643
00:25:45.634 --> 00:25:47.179
My stamina is so low.

644
00:25:50.115 --> 00:25:52.250
I even catch a cold when I get the shot.

645
00:25:52.317 --> 00:25:53.719
It was so hard

646
00:25:54.210 --> 00:25:58.610
This time, I ate well and improved my condition again.

647
00:25:58.677 --> 00:26:00.125
You said last time was the last time?

648
00:26:00.827 --> 00:26:01.901
Are you saying you're not doing it anymore?

649
00:26:01.968 --> 00:26:02.962
When did I?

650
00:26:03.430 --> 00:26:06.800
See how many embryos grow
I said it would only end there.

651
00:26:06.867 --> 00:26:08.835
(Jooyoung) The reason there is not a single embryo is
It wasn't in the script.

652
00:26:08.902 --> 00:26:09.877
It’s invalid, it’s invalid.

653
00:26:09.944 --> 00:26:11.503
Ah, after crying like that

654
00:26:11.570 --> 00:26:13.233
Me? when?

655
00:26:13.300 --> 00:26:14.673
I didn't cry?

656
00:26:14.740 --> 00:26:16.577
[Seungwon’s light sigh]
(Jooyoung) [Satisfied] Write...

657
00:26:16.644 --> 00:26:18.210
I think it'll work out this time

658
00:26:18.877 --> 00:26:20.343
I got the feeling right

659
00:26:20.410 --> 00:26:21.647
[Door lock button sound]

660
00:26:22.221 --> 00:26:24.622
[Sound of door opening]
Huh? Why is he here already?

661
00:26:25.719 --> 00:26:28.638
Put it away! Put it away, put it away
The crab ghost has come, hurry, hurry

662
00:26:32.611 --> 00:26:33.667
(Lee Young) I went

663
00:26:33.734 --> 00:26:35.562
- (Dowon) I went there.
- (Jooyoung) You two are coming together?

664
00:26:35.629 --> 00:26:37.262
(Dowon) Yes, we had dinner together.

665
00:26:39.513 --> 00:26:41.001
Ah! Not just the two of us

666
00:26:41.068 --> 00:26:42.744
With all the first-year kids

667
00:26:42.811 --> 00:26:44.269
(Seungwon) Haha, who said what?

668
00:26:44.336 --> 00:26:46.610
(Jooyoung) Except us
I wonder if I ate something delicious

669
00:26:46.677 --> 00:26:47.806
I ate ribs

670
00:26:47.873 --> 00:26:48.911
I'll wash first

671
00:26:48.978 --> 00:26:50.442
- (Jooyoung) Yes
- (Seungwon) Yes

672
00:26:59.887 --> 00:27:00.895
But sister

673
00:27:02.456 --> 00:27:04.456
[nervous music]

674
00:27:09.263 --> 00:27:10.515
(Lee Young) What is this?

675
00:27:11.932 --> 00:27:12.786
what?

676
00:27:17.069 --> 00:27:18.645
What is this side dish?

677
00:27:18.712 --> 00:27:20.038
[ding sound effect]
[Seungwon’s awkward laughter]
(Jooyoung) Huh?

678
00:27:20.105 --> 00:27:21.333
[light music]
[Seungwon’s awkward laughter]
Ah!

679
00:27:21.400 --> 00:27:23.608
Oh, it's Kim.

680
00:27:23.675 --> 00:27:26.278
As long as I have this, what can I do?
Eat all the food, okay?

681
00:27:26.345 --> 00:27:27.610
[Seungwon’s awkward laughter]

682
00:27:27.677 --> 00:27:29.181
eat well

683
00:27:30.682 --> 00:27:32.219
Brother-in-law, wake me up when you leave tomorrow.

684
00:27:32.286 --> 00:27:34.253
(Seungwon) Okay, sister-in-law, come on.

685
00:27:34.721 --> 00:27:36.356
[Sound of door opening]
Uh, what is it?

686
00:27:36.423 --> 00:27:38.223
[Jooyoung and Seungwon’s light laughter]

687
00:27:38.290 --> 00:27:39.159
It didn't catch me
[Sound of door closing]

688
00:27:39.226 --> 00:27:40.259
[Seungwon’s laughter]

689
00:27:43.330 --> 00:27:45.164
[Sound of crab being sucked]

690
00:27:47.634 --> 00:27:49.835
[Lee Young’s satisfied breathing]
[Sound of crab being sucked]

691
00:27:51.345 --> 00:27:54.534
[Creepy sound effect]

692
00:27:54.601 --> 00:27:58.510
[Tense sound effect]

693
00:28:01.048 --> 00:28:02.081
[Sigh of relief]

694
00:28:04.216 --> 00:28:06.552
[Sound of crab being sucked]

695
00:28:09.120 --> 00:28:10.622
How did you know there was crab sauce?

696
00:28:11.792 --> 00:28:12.977
[Emphasized sound effect]
[Interesting music]

697
00:28:13.044 --> 00:28:15.093
(Lee Young) Did you see the soy sauce that fell next to the seaweed?

698
00:28:15.160 --> 00:28:16.828
It is lighter in color than brewed soy sauce.

699
00:28:16.895 --> 00:28:18.431
It has a better scent than soy sauce.
[Lee Young’s sniffing sound]

700
00:28:18.498 --> 00:28:20.565
So what? It's a crab shop

701
00:28:20.632 --> 00:28:21.733
[Do-won’s light smile]

702
00:28:24.505 --> 00:28:27.441
This is what my brother bought for his sister-in-law.

703
00:28:27.508 --> 00:28:29.608
(Do-won) At my sister-in-law’s favorite house

704
00:28:29.675 --> 00:28:31.076
I would have waited in line to buy it.

705
00:28:32.311 --> 00:28:34.777
So you only eat the legs.

706
00:28:34.844 --> 00:28:35.814
[light laughter]

707
00:28:36.415 --> 00:28:38.452
It would be better not to eat that than to eat that.

708
00:28:38.519 --> 00:28:40.252
I'm still full so it tastes good

709
00:28:41.154 --> 00:28:42.331
I'm just tasting it.

710
00:28:43.200 --> 00:28:45.200
[Sound of crab being sucked]

711
00:28:51.732 --> 00:28:52.752
But why aren't you sleeping?

712
00:28:54.011 --> 00:28:55.374
I have a paper to read.

713
00:28:56.167 --> 00:28:58.436
How many of those boring things are you watching?

714
00:28:58.503 --> 00:29:00.577
You read the paper yesterday and the day before.
I don't even sleep

715
00:29:00.644 --> 00:29:02.141
I slept every now and then at the medical office.

716
00:29:03.143 --> 00:29:04.243
[Clicking tongue]

717
00:29:04.310 --> 00:29:06.310
[Sound of crab being sucked]

718
00:29:06.377 --> 00:29:07.813
Nothing will come out

719
00:29:10.249 --> 00:29:12.084
Stop eating, I’ll buy it for you next time.

720
00:29:15.656 --> 00:29:16.634
Really?

721
00:29:19.459 --> 00:29:21.128
Except my sister and me

722
00:29:22.796 --> 00:29:23.801
I understand

723
00:29:23.868 --> 00:29:25.764
[cute music]

724
00:29:27.067 --> 00:29:28.089
When?

725
00:29:28.702 --> 00:29:30.160
How about this Friday?

726
00:29:31.238 --> 00:29:32.901
- (Dowon) That’s right.
- (Lee Young) Wow

727
00:29:32.968 --> 00:29:34.373
- (Dowon) No.
- (Lee Young) Ah!

728
00:29:35.209 --> 00:29:36.241
Oh, why?

729
00:29:36.742 --> 00:29:38.712
(Dowon) I have somewhere to go, but I forgot.

730
00:29:38.779 --> 00:29:40.312
(Lee Young), tsk!

731
00:29:52.226 --> 00:29:54.059
[Mouse operation sound]

732
00:29:55.148 --> 00:29:57.529
[Keyboard operation sound]

733
00:29:57.596 --> 00:29:59.831
(Jeongmin) Teacher Goo Do-won, are you on vacation starting tomorrow?

734
00:30:00.344 --> 00:30:01.233
Did you pay for 3 days?

735
00:30:01.300 --> 00:30:02.200
Yes, professor

736
00:30:02.267 --> 00:30:03.835
(Jeongmin) Write a few more days

737
00:30:03.902 --> 00:30:05.537
There's been a lot of work in the past.

738
00:30:05.604 --> 00:30:07.834
I had a hard time with my thesis.

739
00:30:07.901 --> 00:30:08.941
Yes? what?

740
00:30:09.574 --> 00:30:10.642
Take a good rest

741
00:30:10.709 --> 00:30:12.946
'Cause I won't let anyone call

742
00:30:13.013 --> 00:30:14.764
(Dowon) Yes, thank you

743
00:30:17.877 --> 00:30:18.951
[Sound of urgent breathing]

744
00:30:19.419 --> 00:30:21.053
(Kiseon) Dowon, are you on vacation starting tomorrow?

745
00:30:21.620 --> 00:30:23.267
- Is it true?
- Yes, Professor.

746
00:30:23.334 --> 00:30:25.056
(Kiseon) Then, let me go today

747
00:30:25.123 --> 00:30:26.833
Can’t I help out a lot and go?

748
00:30:26.900 --> 00:30:27.767
It's okay, professor.

749
00:30:27.834 --> 00:30:31.315
(Kiseon) Then, I will hold a summer symposium.
Presentation materials and thesis materials

750
00:30:31.382 --> 00:30:34.366
Professor Lim Dong-ju’s retirement ceremony preparation plan
It would be nice if you could take a look

751
00:30:35.302 --> 00:30:36.477
[Sigh of the steamer]

752
00:30:36.544 --> 00:30:39.137
I can't believe what kids do

753
00:30:39.805 --> 00:30:40.805
(Dowon) Yes, I understand.

754
00:30:40.872 --> 00:30:44.743
(steamer) and
I have two surgeries today.

755
00:30:44.810 --> 00:30:46.300
Oh, I'm going to go into all of that.

756
00:30:46.367 --> 00:30:47.979
[Happy laughter]

757
00:30:48.046 --> 00:30:49.748
When I'm on vacation, never, never

758
00:30:49.815 --> 00:30:51.253
I won't call you, uh

759
00:30:51.320 --> 00:30:52.484
-Thank you
- (Dowon) Yes

760
00:30:53.153 --> 00:30:56.623
(Lee Young) I’m asking you to go on vacation or not.

761
00:30:56.690 --> 00:30:58.257
[Mouse operation sound]

762
00:31:01.834 --> 00:31:03.834
[Interesting music]

763
00:31:11.972 --> 00:31:14.610
There was a rumor that the Chief was going on vacation.

764
00:31:14.677 --> 00:31:15.909
(Dowon) Yes, professor.

765
00:31:15.976 --> 00:31:17.743
Uh, are you busy today?

766
00:31:18.677 --> 00:31:19.911
No, I'm not busy

767
00:31:20.777 --> 00:31:21.810
(Junmo) Right?

768
00:31:21.877 --> 00:31:22.781
(Dowon) Yes

769
00:31:27.377 --> 00:31:30.255
Because of the surgery record
Did you get scolded a lot by Professor Jo Jun-mo?

770
00:31:30.322 --> 00:31:31.256
(Nanjing) Yes

771
00:31:32.277 --> 00:31:34.728
Oh my, look

772
00:31:34.795 --> 00:31:38.013
(Dowon) If the surgery record shows positive
Be sure to write down the weight of your uterus

773
00:31:38.632 --> 00:31:40.210
[Keyboard operation sound]
And when I draw pictures of the surgery

774
00:31:40.277 --> 00:31:43.610
An arrow indicates the direction in which the uterus was taken out.

775
00:31:43.677 --> 00:31:45.205
Ah!

776
00:31:45.272 --> 00:31:46.267
[Mouse operation sound]
(Dowon) Yes

777
00:31:47.205 --> 00:31:49.009
Ah, the first case of surgery tomorrow

778
00:31:49.076 --> 00:31:51.200
To the professor tonight
I'll give you one more notice

779
00:31:51.267 --> 00:31:52.244
Especially the last surgery tomorrow.

780
00:31:52.311 --> 00:31:55.013
Because I have to send Frozen
Don't forget to make an appointment at the pathology department.

781
00:31:55.080 --> 00:31:56.548
yes, i understand

782
00:31:57.677 --> 00:31:59.644
(Namkyung) Are you coming in for surgery tomorrow?

783
00:31:59.711 --> 00:32:02.187
(Dowon) Uhm, I’m not there tomorrow, I’m going on vacation.

784
00:32:02.821 --> 00:32:04.022
That's right!

785
00:32:04.089 --> 00:32:06.458
Oh, where are you going on vacation?

786
00:32:06.525 --> 00:32:08.527
Taiwan, on a plane

787
00:32:10.067 --> 00:32:11.477
(Dowon) What’s wrong with this agreement?

788
00:32:11.544 --> 00:32:13.033
(Namkyung) Oh, that?

789
00:32:13.100 --> 00:32:15.836
That's for grandma's pancakes.
I chose it in large letters.

790
00:32:16.435 --> 00:32:17.936
Pyeongnam mung bean pancake grandmother?

791
00:32:19.171 --> 00:32:21.906
The font size on the surgery consent form was too small.

792
00:32:21.973 --> 00:32:23.343
I think it will be difficult to see

793
00:32:23.410 --> 00:32:25.801
(Dowon) Oh

794
00:32:25.868 --> 00:32:28.381
The guardian asked me to keep it a secret.

795
00:32:28.448 --> 00:32:30.277
You don't know you have cancer.

796
00:32:30.344 --> 00:32:33.500
Well, I wonder if it says cancer on it.
Just to check

797
00:32:33.567 --> 00:32:35.122
(Dowon) Oh!

798
00:32:35.189 --> 00:32:38.023
Oh, well, I have nothing to say.

799
00:32:39.011 --> 00:32:40.434
(Namkyung) I’m worried about the intern.

800
00:32:40.501 --> 00:32:42.076
He's a bit of a troublemaker.

801
00:32:42.143 --> 00:32:43.477
You're Teacher Tak Gion, right?

802
00:32:43.544 --> 00:32:44.496
Are you doing well?

803
00:32:44.563 --> 00:32:45.699
(Namkyung) Um...

804
00:32:45.766 --> 00:32:47.632
I am teaching well.

805
00:32:48.603 --> 00:32:51.937
Boy, he trusted and relied on me a lot.

806
00:32:52.004 --> 00:32:53.598
[Nanjing’s laughter]
(Dowon) Oh, oh!

807
00:32:55.309 --> 00:32:56.777
(Main role) Teacher Nam-kyung Pyo

808
00:32:56.844 --> 00:32:58.042
(Namkyung) Yes?

809
00:32:58.109 --> 00:33:00.278
I think you should go see it.

810
00:33:00.747 --> 00:33:01.847
(Namkyung) Ah...

811
00:33:02.534 --> 00:33:04.349
[light music]

812
00:33:05.167 --> 00:33:06.151
[Embarrassed laughter]

813
00:33:07.855 --> 00:33:08.954
Wait a minute

814
00:33:09.544 --> 00:33:10.522
(Patient 2) Yes

815
00:33:12.157 --> 00:33:13.291
(Nanjing) Wait a minute

816
00:33:18.966 --> 00:33:19.931
[Nanjing’s sigh]

817
00:33:21.869 --> 00:33:22.934
Teacher Tak Gion?

818
00:33:23.767 --> 00:33:25.336
It's not like putting a star on a ship.

819
00:33:25.403 --> 00:33:27.105
What if I put it like that?

820
00:33:28.208 --> 00:33:29.499
yes?

821
00:33:29.566 --> 00:33:31.276
Ah, then how?

822
00:33:31.343 --> 00:33:33.011
Long from top to bottom of the affected area

823
00:33:33.078 --> 00:33:34.078
This must be placed vertically

824
00:33:34.145 --> 00:33:36.217
Won't the open skin stick together well?

825
00:33:36.284 --> 00:33:37.215
(Temperature) Ah...

826
00:33:37.684 --> 00:33:38.650
sorry

827
00:33:39.417 --> 00:33:42.022
Whenever I take a shower at home,
I'm afraid it might get in the water

828
00:33:42.089 --> 00:33:43.289
(Nanjing) No

829
00:33:43.356 --> 00:33:47.025
Now with Hemobag
They're not good at removing PICCs, so I do it all.

830
00:33:47.528 --> 00:33:48.862
[Nankyung’s light breathing]

831
00:33:48.929 --> 00:33:51.115
I just keep having more work to do.

832
00:33:51.182 --> 00:33:53.551
You should be good at taping yourself.

833
00:33:54.234 --> 00:33:55.700
sorry

834
00:33:55.767 --> 00:33:56.970
Take care...

835
00:33:57.037 --> 00:33:58.370
Please take care of me

836
00:34:00.338 --> 00:34:01.374
[Nankyung’s awkward laughter]

837
00:34:01.441 --> 00:34:02.641
yes

838
00:34:06.497 --> 00:34:07.547
- (Nanjing) Patient
- (Patient 2) Yes

839
00:34:07.614 --> 00:34:10.848
(Namkyung) I guess the tape
I think I'll have to take it off and put it back on.

840
00:34:11.410 --> 00:34:12.451
(Patient 2) Do this again?

841
00:34:12.978 --> 00:34:14.186
(Namkyung) Ah, yes

842
00:34:15.189 --> 00:34:18.300
Avoid getting water in the shower
Be careful

843
00:34:18.367 --> 00:34:19.824
When you come to the next outpatient visit

844
00:34:19.891 --> 00:34:22.877
Check whether the wound has healed well
I'll dress you again.

845
00:34:22.944 --> 00:34:23.929
yes

846
00:34:24.477 --> 00:34:26.130
(Jaehwi) Hello

847
00:34:26.197 --> 00:34:28.301
I heard you're going down early tomorrow morning by car.

848
00:34:28.368 --> 00:34:30.844
I rushed to prepare for discharge.

849
00:34:30.911 --> 00:34:32.137
(Patient 2) Thank you

850
00:34:32.804 --> 00:34:34.205
Oh, by the way, professor.

851
00:34:34.272 --> 00:34:36.141
Is this okay?

852
00:34:36.875 --> 00:34:38.979
(Patient 2) Isn’t it going to fall soon?
I want to have it

853
00:34:39.046 --> 00:34:41.513
(Namkyung) Oh, you don’t have to worry.
I put it on well

854
00:34:41.580 --> 00:34:45.483
No, the male teacher over there earlier was
You attached it very carefully.

855
00:34:45.550 --> 00:34:47.477
(Patient 2) What the teacher added here is a little bit

856
00:34:47.544 --> 00:34:48.710
I'm anxious

857
00:34:48.777 --> 00:34:52.591
(Jaehwi) Well, if I do that
I'll take a look again

858
00:34:55.162 --> 00:34:58.110
Um, did you attach it well?

859
00:34:58.177 --> 00:34:59.264
(Patient 2) Oh, really?

860
00:35:00.300 --> 00:35:01.289
(Jaehwi) Sseu-eup

861
00:35:02.812 --> 00:35:04.202
Isn't it amazing?

862
00:35:04.269 --> 00:35:05.303
[Proud laughter]

863
00:35:06.204 --> 00:35:08.467
No, our male teacher
How did you put it on?

864
00:35:08.534 --> 00:35:10.377
Are you saying it was put together better than this?

865
00:35:10.444 --> 00:35:11.976
[humorous music]
(Patient 2) Oh, make sure not a single drop of water gets in.

866
00:35:12.043 --> 00:35:14.610
How carefully did you paste it?

867
00:35:14.677 --> 00:35:16.414
I put it back on for no reason

868
00:35:17.100 --> 00:35:18.583
Oh no, that's not it...

869
00:35:18.650 --> 00:35:20.220
(Jaehwi) Oh, it’s okay, it’s okay.

870
00:35:20.287 --> 00:35:22.322
Ah, in times like this, put some humility in your mind.

871
00:35:22.389 --> 00:35:23.534
(temperature) Yes?

872
00:35:23.601 --> 00:35:24.791
Ah...

873
00:35:24.858 --> 00:35:25.824
(Jaehwi) Oh

874
00:35:26.611 --> 00:35:28.460
(Gion) Ah... thank you

875
00:35:29.596 --> 00:35:31.011
(Jaehwi) Miss, I’m curious.

876
00:35:31.078 --> 00:35:32.133
[Awkward laughter]

877
00:35:32.200 --> 00:35:34.599
[Announcement sound]

878
00:35:37.237 --> 00:35:38.831
- (Sabi) Oh Iyoung, what are you doing?
- (Lee Young) Oh, it’s a surprise.

879
00:35:39.883 --> 00:35:40.878
I'm trying to get money

880
00:35:41.406 --> 00:35:42.274
What about you?

881
00:35:42.910 --> 00:35:44.801
- I had some savings.
- Savings?

882
00:35:44.868 --> 00:35:46.546
(Sabi) Uh, it’s expired so I’m canceling it.

883
00:35:46.613 --> 00:35:47.479
Expiration?

884
00:35:48.377 --> 00:35:50.682
Wow, there's someone who can do that.

885
00:35:51.282 --> 00:35:52.784
(Sabi) You may suddenly need a lot of money.

886
00:35:52.851 --> 00:35:55.689
You can move
I can go on a trip, I have to save up.

887
00:35:56.655 --> 00:35:58.957
You don't do it because you don't know, or you don't do it because you can't do it.

888
00:35:59.024 --> 00:36:00.293
Don’t you have savings?

889
00:36:00.360 --> 00:36:01.526
Have you never tried it before?

890
00:36:01.593 --> 00:36:03.762
Wow, there are people who live like that.
[ATM operating sound]

891
00:36:05.444 --> 00:36:07.165
But I do do something similar.

892
00:36:07.232 --> 00:36:08.066
What are you doing?

893
00:36:10.410 --> 00:36:12.804
Lotto, there is a good place in front of my house

894
00:36:12.871 --> 00:36:14.443
They say he came in first place 8 times.

895
00:36:14.510 --> 00:36:15.507
[light sigh]

896
00:36:16.210 --> 00:36:18.610
[cell phone ringing sound]

897
00:36:19.580 --> 00:36:20.580
(together) Huh?

898
00:36:20.647 --> 00:36:21.813
I guess the mother has arrived

899
00:36:23.350 --> 00:36:24.349
- (Lee Young) Yes, teacher.
- (Sabi) Yes

900
00:36:24.416 --> 00:36:25.277
(Lee Young) Ah, yes, I’ll go right away.

901
00:36:25.344 --> 00:36:27.076
- (Sabi) I'm on my way, teacher.
- (Lee Young) No, no, no

902
00:36:27.143 --> 00:36:30.288
[Sound of newborn babies crying]
(Sabi) 10cm to the left
I think 5cm to the right should be enough?

903
00:36:30.791 --> 00:36:31.823
(Mugang) Hey, teacher.

904
00:36:32.626 --> 00:36:34.128
What kind of parking lot is this?

905
00:36:34.744 --> 00:36:35.867
(Sabi) Just push a little bit

906
00:36:35.934 --> 00:36:37.977
Just one size fits all
I think it will work

907
00:36:38.044 --> 00:36:39.744
I have no one to take care of

908
00:36:39.811 --> 00:36:41.933
Can it be solved by just pushing Bassinet?

909
00:36:42.000 --> 00:36:43.778
'Cause you can't push the baby in

910
00:36:43.845 --> 00:36:45.104
I need to push this in.

911
00:36:46.011 --> 00:36:48.272
(Mugang) We’re still saturated.

912
00:36:48.339 --> 00:36:50.174
Yesterday, there were three mothers with twins.
Don't you remember?

913
00:36:50.241 --> 00:36:51.187
I remember

914
00:36:51.254 --> 00:36:52.443
2 o'clock, 5 o'clock, 1 a.m.

915
00:36:52.510 --> 00:36:53.845
(Mugang) Oh, right?

916
00:36:53.912 --> 00:36:55.713
Obstetrics and delivery are three.

917
00:36:55.780 --> 00:36:58.149
Our pediatrics department is growing by six, you know?

918
00:36:59.084 --> 00:37:00.385
It's not because we don't want to receive it.

919
00:37:00.452 --> 00:37:01.600
Oh, it really doesn't work...
[Newborn baby cries]

920
00:37:01.667 --> 00:37:02.901
[Mugang’s soothing sounds for a newborn]

921
00:37:02.968 --> 00:37:04.200
Are you hungry?

922
00:37:04.267 --> 00:37:05.824
Wait a minute

923
00:37:07.294 --> 00:37:08.233
Baby, you're pretty

924
00:37:08.300 --> 00:37:10.263
There is no one

925
00:37:10.330 --> 00:37:11.663
Don’t you even watch the news?

926
00:37:11.730 --> 00:37:13.710
Our pediatric department has no applicants.
Not even a year

927
00:37:13.777 --> 00:37:15.133
One by one, everyone disappears.

928
00:37:15.200 --> 00:37:16.367
So I'm on duty, on duty, on duty

929
00:37:16.434 --> 00:37:19.039
I've barely slept for 36 hours now.

930
00:37:19.106 --> 00:37:21.272
I think that's a pity too.

931
00:37:21.339 --> 00:37:24.610
But why do you always ask me
Are you talking about the reality of pediatrics?

932
00:37:24.677 --> 00:37:25.901
[sigh]

933
00:37:25.968 --> 00:37:28.300
I'm telling you it can't be done.

934
00:37:28.367 --> 00:37:29.881
[Laughing awkwardly] No.

935
00:37:29.948 --> 00:37:31.384
(Sabi) I can’t either.

936
00:37:31.451 --> 00:37:34.000
Professor Seo Jeong-min
All the mothers said they couldn't go.

937
00:37:34.067 --> 00:37:35.622
No, then when the baby is born

938
00:37:35.689 --> 00:37:37.691
Will the teacher give me food?
I gave him food, held him, and slept with him...

939
00:37:38.757 --> 00:37:39.593
[Embarrassed laughter]

940
00:37:39.660 --> 00:37:42.560
Are you going to hug me and put me to sleep?

941
00:37:42.627 --> 00:37:44.429
Can I hold you and feed you?

942
00:37:45.632 --> 00:37:47.333
(Sabi) If I give you food
Can I put a bassinet in it?

943
00:37:47.400 --> 00:37:49.067
Hey there
[cell phone ringing sound]

944
00:37:51.638 --> 00:37:53.071
Yes, this is Moogang Park, a pediatrician.

945
00:37:54.174 --> 00:37:56.467
(Mu-gang) Is Heeyul throwing up? I'll be right there

946
00:37:56.534 --> 00:37:59.513
[Call end sound]
Oh, I clearly said no.

947
00:37:59.580 --> 00:38:01.346
Just add a bassinet, really.

948
00:38:04.852 --> 00:38:07.152
[Splendid music]

949
00:38:14.359 --> 00:38:16.360
[Call connection tone]

950
00:38:16.427 --> 00:38:17.895
(Sabi) Lee Young-ah, you’re settled in.

951
00:38:17.962 --> 00:38:18.930
(Lee Young) Okay

952
00:38:22.200 --> 00:38:23.201
Oh!

953
00:38:25.005 --> 00:38:26.673
- (Dongho) There is no room.
- (Lee Young) There’s no room, right?

954
00:38:26.740 --> 00:38:28.933
I know, I have to, it’s urgent.

955
00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:30.208
(Dongho) It must be urgent.

956
00:38:30.711 --> 00:38:33.467
To open the room now
Another surgery needs to be delayed.

957
00:38:33.534 --> 00:38:35.780
No, I had obstetrics yesterday early in the morning too.
All other surgeries were postponed

958
00:38:35.847 --> 00:38:37.210
How much we were criticized

959
00:38:37.277 --> 00:38:38.916
(Lee Young) Please, just this once.

960
00:38:38.983 --> 00:38:40.585
Do we really have to have a C-section?

961
00:38:40.652 --> 00:38:41.788
(Dongho) You saw it on the way here.

962
00:38:41.855 --> 00:38:44.090
Right now, there are no anesthesiologists and no room.

963
00:38:44.157 --> 00:38:45.903
The surgery itself is impossible.

964
00:38:47.458 --> 00:38:50.428
(Lee Young) Then it will never happen.
Is that what you mean?

965
00:38:50.495 --> 00:38:51.465
(Dongho) Yes

966
00:38:51.532 --> 00:38:52.734
(Lee Young) Then, to the mother,

967
00:38:52.801 --> 00:38:54.098
Because I can't do surgery because of the anesthesiology department.

968
00:38:54.165 --> 00:38:56.300
I'll tell everyone to go.

969
00:38:56.367 --> 00:38:58.169
[lively music]
(Dongho) Huh, what?

970
00:38:58.236 --> 00:38:59.904
No, are you threatening me now?

971
00:38:59.971 --> 00:39:01.171
(Lee Young) Otherwise

972
00:39:01.238 --> 00:39:02.406
Until the anesthesiologist gives me a room

973
00:39:02.473 --> 00:39:05.400
Just hold on to having a baby
Shall I tell you?

974
00:39:05.467 --> 00:39:08.377
(Dongho) Wow, that was really bad, that was really bad.

975
00:39:08.444 --> 00:39:10.667
(Lee Young) I am now
Because it’s not the time to look after someone’s situation.

976
00:39:10.734 --> 00:39:12.684
They say there is no hospital that will accept me right now.

977
00:39:13.911 --> 00:39:15.186
[Dongho’s sigh]

978
00:39:18.225 --> 00:39:20.158
[Call connection tone]

979
00:39:20.727 --> 00:39:22.059
(Dongho) Uh, Sanghyun.

980
00:39:22.126 --> 00:39:24.129
Just postpone the decision to have that OS surgery for a little while.

981
00:39:24.831 --> 00:39:27.332
Oh, just wish you one more time
It's not an emergency there.

982
00:39:28.135 --> 00:39:29.000
uh

983
00:39:29.634 --> 00:39:30.635
Just one hour

984
00:39:31.638 --> 00:39:33.165
Who could it be, Sanggwaji?

985
00:39:36.841 --> 00:39:38.512
[Soft music]
(Lee Young) Thank you!

986
00:39:41.748 --> 00:39:43.481
[Call connection tone]

987
00:39:43.548 --> 00:39:45.652
(Lee Young) Ah, professor, we have set up the operating room.

988
00:39:45.719 --> 00:39:46.851
I'm going to give birth.

989
00:39:47.919 --> 00:39:49.919
[Noisy noise]

990
00:39:51.089 --> 00:39:53.644
(Japan) Teacher
I got a call saying the mother was here.

991
00:39:53.711 --> 00:39:55.110
(Junseok) Stay over there, I’ll be right there.

992
00:39:55.177 --> 00:39:56.094
(Japan) Yes

993
00:39:56.597 --> 00:39:58.029
[Patient 3 groans in pain]

994
00:39:58.532 --> 00:40:00.544
- (Junseok) Call the neurosurgeon.
- (Resident 1) Yes

995
00:40:00.611 --> 00:40:02.901
I'll disinfect it, it stings.

996
00:40:05.777 --> 00:40:07.972
(Jaeil) Ah, I have quite a fever.

997
00:40:09.310 --> 00:40:10.267
teacher

998
00:40:10.334 --> 00:40:12.410
Did you get the maternal CBC and CRP results?

999
00:40:13.278 --> 00:40:14.145
(Junseok) Ah

1000
00:40:15.349 --> 00:40:17.151
Ha, I haven't done that yet.

1001
00:40:18.018 --> 00:40:19.024
What about UA?

1002
00:40:19.711 --> 00:40:21.544
I was going to do that too

1003
00:40:21.611 --> 00:40:23.710
Because the mother says she can't urinate

1004
00:40:23.777 --> 00:40:24.722
I haven't done it yet

1005
00:40:24.789 --> 00:40:25.877
Ah...

1006
00:40:25.944 --> 00:40:29.627
So you're calling me when the test hasn't even been done?

1007
00:40:30.197 --> 00:40:31.609
[Awkward laughter]
[shameful breathing]

1008
00:40:33.834 --> 00:40:35.032
I'm sorry, Teacher Eom Jae-il.

1009
00:40:35.099 --> 00:40:37.367
Maybe a maternal test

1010
00:40:37.434 --> 00:40:39.404
Can you please take me up to the delivery room and do some work for me?

1011
00:40:40.109 --> 00:40:41.208
(Junseok) When we are busy

1012
00:40:41.275 --> 00:40:43.601
Other obstetricians and gynecologists
They said they would do that.

1013
00:40:46.680 --> 00:40:48.346
There are a lot of patients today

1014
00:40:48.413 --> 00:40:49.801
It's a full bed now

1015
00:40:49.868 --> 00:40:51.015
Hey, look here.

1016
00:40:54.675 --> 00:40:55.718
(Japan) Ah!

1017
00:40:56.223 --> 00:40:57.624
It's the same as our delivery room.

1018
00:40:57.691 --> 00:40:58.834
[lively music]
[sigh]

1019
00:40:58.901 --> 00:41:00.391
The labor room is now full beds.

1020
00:41:00.458 --> 00:41:02.260
It's real chaos.

1021
00:41:02.794 --> 00:41:04.476
(Junseok) Oh, I see.
[Junseok’s sigh]

1022
00:41:06.264 --> 00:41:08.299
But why not just once?

1023
00:41:08.366 --> 00:41:09.810
(Japan) Write...

1024
00:41:09.877 --> 00:41:11.605
Ah...

1025
00:41:11.672 --> 00:41:12.804
Is this going to happen?

1026
00:41:19.213 --> 00:41:20.478
sorry

1027
00:41:20.545 --> 00:41:21.756
We are too busy

1028
00:41:21.823 --> 00:41:23.350
[Soft music]
(Jaeil) Please take a urine test.

1029
00:41:23.417 --> 00:41:25.352
Blood tests: CBC, CRP, PCT

1030
00:41:25.419 --> 00:41:26.925
Electro, OTPT, BUN

1031
00:41:26.992 --> 00:41:28.021
Give me creatinine

1032
00:41:28.088 --> 00:41:29.777
If you can inspect Apé Sono as well,

1033
00:41:29.844 --> 00:41:33.093
I quickly and accurately
I'll upload it to the mother.

1034
00:41:33.160 --> 00:41:34.141
[Junseok’s helpless groan]

1035
00:41:34.926 --> 00:41:35.827
yes

1036
00:41:36.444 --> 00:41:38.496
Then, please contact me when you finish the inspection.

1037
00:41:39.666 --> 00:41:40.721
thank you

1038
00:41:44.901 --> 00:41:46.076
(Resident 1) You’ve become a lot smarter, haven’t you?

1039
00:41:46.143 --> 00:41:48.675
(Junseok) Ha, it was a failure.

1040
00:41:48.742 --> 00:41:50.775
Ah, it wasn't that kind of character originally.

1041
00:41:52.544 --> 00:41:54.612
- Teacher, I'm going to take a blood test here.
- (Nurse 3) Yes

1042
00:41:55.516 --> 00:41:56.781
(Together) It looks delicious.

1043
00:41:57.251 --> 00:41:59.377
(Lee Young) Wow, nice, nice, nice

1044
00:41:59.444 --> 00:42:01.419
(Nanjing) Let’s eat, let’s eat, let’s eat, let’s eat

1045
00:42:01.486 --> 00:42:03.290
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1046
00:42:03.357 --> 00:42:05.334
- (Jaeil) Enjoy your meal!
- (Namkyung, Lee Young) Enjoy your meal!

1047
00:42:11.098 --> 00:42:12.163
[Lee Young’s satisfied moans]

1048
00:42:13.564 --> 00:42:15.633
I didn't even have the strength to break the bones, but the boneless meat was a mess.

1049
00:42:15.700 --> 00:42:17.167
The mother said she was my lord.

1050
00:42:17.234 --> 00:42:19.370
Thanks to you, I don’t have to go to another hospital.
I had a good baby

1051
00:42:20.277 --> 00:42:21.439
[Jaeil’s satisfying elasticity]

1052
00:42:21.506 --> 00:42:23.818
(Jaeil) That’s right, chicken on a good day

1053
00:42:23.885 --> 00:42:26.667
(Namkyung) Hey, but you guys
Why do you feel so good, huh?

1054
00:42:26.734 --> 00:42:29.549
at 11:30
I can't even go home right now and I'm like this.

1055
00:42:29.616 --> 00:42:31.751
(Japan) I got a kick out of the emergency medicine department.

1056
00:42:31.818 --> 00:42:33.620
Hitting the bone with a fact
You said it was made with boneless meat?

1057
00:42:33.687 --> 00:42:35.066
Hey, good job

1058
00:42:35.133 --> 00:42:37.300
Because everyone tolerates us
I think you're really stupid

1059
00:42:37.367 --> 00:42:38.377
(Japan) That’s right

1060
00:42:38.444 --> 00:42:39.790
What blessings are there if you endure it?

1061
00:42:39.857 --> 00:42:41.061
I got a vase

1062
00:42:41.128 --> 00:42:42.434
No!

1063
00:42:42.501 --> 00:42:44.600
Don't hold back y'all, eh? be careful!

1064
00:42:44.667 --> 00:42:46.464
That's right, if you can endure it three times

1065
00:42:47.100 --> 00:42:48.435
I held back too much

1066
00:42:48.502 --> 00:42:49.700
no more

1067
00:42:49.767 --> 00:42:50.867
(Nanjing) What, what is it?

1068
00:42:50.934 --> 00:42:53.507
Why are you three suddenly like this?
Can you communicate well?

1069
00:42:53.574 --> 00:42:56.474
Now, what a single mind! Daedong unity!

1070
00:42:56.541 --> 00:42:57.553
What are you doing like this?

1071
00:42:58.277 --> 00:42:59.610
Is that right?
[Knocking sound]

1072
00:43:00.914 --> 00:43:02.015
(Dowon) Guys

1073
00:43:02.082 --> 00:43:03.948
Take care of maternal operability after surgery

1074
00:43:04.015 --> 00:43:05.416
MFICU mother Hojin Ahn

1075
00:43:05.483 --> 00:43:08.586
Because it looks like I'm going to give birth soon
I need to watch carefully to see if the contractions are going well.

1076
00:43:09.056 --> 00:43:09.966
(together) yes

1077
00:43:10.033 --> 00:43:11.333
(Jae-il) But haven’t you gotten off work yet?

1078
00:43:11.400 --> 00:43:12.690
Isn't there a flight tomorrow morning?

1079
00:43:14.125 --> 00:43:16.694
I'm just going to pack my bags and go, bye bye.

1080
00:43:18.129 --> 00:43:19.430
(Dowon) Ah, ah!

1081
00:43:20.310 --> 00:43:23.301
You guys called and said, where are you?

1082
00:43:23.368 --> 00:43:24.809
Excuse me, can I ask one question?

1083
00:43:24.876 --> 00:43:25.872
You especially Eom Jae-il

1084
00:43:25.939 --> 00:43:27.734
Don't do that, I won't let you.

1085
00:43:27.801 --> 00:43:29.006
Ah!

1086
00:43:29.073 --> 00:43:31.150
The vacation isn't 3 months, it's only 3 days?

1087
00:43:31.217 --> 00:43:32.743
What do you think of us?

1088
00:43:32.810 --> 00:43:34.848
(Namkyung) We’re doing it now too, right?

1089
00:43:34.915 --> 00:43:36.443
Don't worry

1090
00:43:36.510 --> 00:43:37.801
(Sabi) Have a nice trip

1091
00:43:37.868 --> 00:43:39.350
The gift just needs to be small.

1092
00:43:41.367 --> 00:43:42.333
yes

1093
00:43:42.400 --> 00:43:43.343
see you next week

1094
00:43:43.410 --> 00:43:44.896
- (Japan) Please be careful.
- (Nanjing) Take care.

1095
00:43:52.096 --> 00:43:55.343
(Xavi) If you ask a question, ask the Chief.

1096
00:43:55.410 --> 00:43:56.801
(Jaeil) I was wrong

1097
00:43:58.102 --> 00:44:00.338
It's the chief's fault for not checking.
Bring it to me quickly

1098
00:44:02.242 --> 00:44:04.575
(Lee Young) How many times do I tell you that I don’t have a rescuer?

1099
00:44:05.078 --> 00:44:06.033
[Sound of hitting the wall]

1100
00:44:06.100 --> 00:44:07.245
The shocking thing is

1101
00:44:08.916 --> 00:44:10.782
I haven't even been on vacation for a day yet

1102
00:44:11.877 --> 00:44:13.017
[Everyone sighs]

1103
00:44:14.217 --> 00:44:15.689
[Mobile phone call incoming sound]

1104
00:44:15.756 --> 00:44:16.733
(Namkyung) Huh?

1105
00:44:18.777 --> 00:44:19.834
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1106
00:44:19.901 --> 00:44:21.625
Everyone is looking for Mr. Chief.

1107
00:44:21.692 --> 00:44:23.230
Why is he only looking for me?

1108
00:44:23.297 --> 00:44:25.332
- (Japan) Who?
- (Nanjing) Intern

1109
00:44:25.399 --> 00:44:28.299
I feel anxious when left alone and angry when we are together.

1110
00:44:31.903 --> 00:44:34.472
Gu Do-won must have been like that too, right?

1111
00:44:35.078 --> 00:44:36.240
[Everyone sighs]

1112
00:44:38.111 --> 00:44:39.780
(Nanjing) I have to go before something happens.

1113
00:44:39.847 --> 00:44:40.845
[lively music]
Going

1114
00:44:44.844 --> 00:44:46.084
[Everyone sighs]

1115
00:44:49.978 --> 00:44:51.122
[Sigh of temperature]

1116
00:44:56.330 --> 00:44:57.995
(temperature) Ah, this is different from that.

1117
00:44:58.632 --> 00:45:00.097
Consent form for painless injection

1118
00:45:00.164 --> 00:45:02.800
When you're sick
I'm going to use medicine that won't hurt.

1119
00:45:02.867 --> 00:45:04.210
What is it about?

1120
00:45:04.277 --> 00:45:05.567
If you look here

1121
00:45:05.634 --> 00:45:08.875
(Jaok) No, I just removed a small lump.
That must be really painful?

1122
00:45:08.942 --> 00:45:10.074
[Mutual clears cough]

1123
00:45:12.277 --> 00:45:13.544
It's different for each person.

1124
00:45:14.245 --> 00:45:16.600
Because you are older
Because it might hurt a little more

1125
00:45:16.667 --> 00:45:18.901
We want to prepare medicine in advance.

1126
00:45:18.968 --> 00:45:21.377
How long does it take to remove the lump?

1127
00:45:21.444 --> 00:45:24.844
Yes, if you do all the preparation and anesthesia,

1128
00:45:24.911 --> 00:45:26.133
About an hour and a half

1129
00:45:26.200 --> 00:45:27.291
(Jaok) Hmm

1130
00:45:27.777 --> 00:45:29.801
It's taking longer than I thought

1131
00:45:29.868 --> 00:45:33.127
Yes, cancer surgery usually takes a while.

1132
00:45:33.194 --> 00:45:35.877
(temperature) Still, compared to other cancer surgeries,
It's short

1133
00:45:35.944 --> 00:45:37.635
(Jaok) Yes, really?

1134
00:45:41.441 --> 00:45:42.504
Cancer surgery?

1135
00:45:43.611 --> 00:45:44.542
yes

1136
00:45:45.512 --> 00:45:46.479
Who?

1137
00:45:47.514 --> 00:45:48.486
I?

1138
00:45:49.100 --> 00:45:51.100
[heavy music]

1139
00:45:53.120 --> 00:45:55.953
If I have cancer surgery, it means I have cancer.

1140
00:45:56.423 --> 00:45:57.788
Ho, it’s not a lump, it’s cancer?

1141
00:46:01.822 --> 00:46:03.296
Yes, I...

1142
00:46:03.363 --> 00:46:05.082
It's cancer...

1143
00:46:11.177 --> 00:46:12.370
(Jaok) So

1144
00:46:13.273 --> 00:46:17.841
From a long time ago, I was the only one left out
Everyone knew, did I have cancer?

1145
00:46:17.908 --> 00:46:21.148
Everyone in the hospital together
How do you fool a patient?

1146
00:46:21.215 --> 00:46:22.580
(Mutual) I asked for it, I

1147
00:46:23.414 --> 00:46:25.983
Mom, it was obvious that you wouldn’t want to have surgery.

1148
00:46:29.377 --> 00:46:30.488
(Jaehwi) Are you having surgery?

1149
00:46:32.177 --> 00:46:34.600
In the video, it looks like the very beginning.

1150
00:46:34.667 --> 00:46:37.911
And it is expected that the progress will be good.

1151
00:46:37.978 --> 00:46:40.298
And this laparoscopic surgery

1152
00:46:41.281 --> 00:46:42.367
The wound is not big

1153
00:46:42.434 --> 00:46:44.534
So recovery will be quick.

1154
00:46:44.601 --> 00:46:47.505
I thought my brother would be able to survive too.

1155
00:46:48.141 --> 00:46:50.878
In the end, I ended up having a hard time at the hospital.

1156
00:46:52.179 --> 00:46:54.981
Oh no, I won't waste my time like that.

1157
00:46:55.949 --> 00:46:58.816
Because we're all old now
Are you asking me to stop living?

1158
00:46:58.883 --> 00:47:00.418
Is it okay to just die when you get old?

1159
00:47:00.951 --> 00:47:02.222
(Mutual) Huh?

1160
00:47:02.289 --> 00:47:03.857
Who says that?

1161
00:47:03.924 --> 00:47:06.023
Oh, it's in the law, it's in the books?

1162
00:47:06.090 --> 00:47:08.038
Let's do the surgery, Mom, okay?

1163
00:47:09.051 --> 00:47:10.494
Cook more pancakes

1164
00:47:11.028 --> 00:47:13.364
Let’s get more kids operated on.

1165
00:47:13.431 --> 00:47:15.132
I'm not asking you to live with your mother.

1166
00:47:15.199 --> 00:47:16.367
Let's save the kids, kids.

1167
00:47:18.243 --> 00:47:19.203
Do you hate that too?

1168
00:47:20.073 --> 00:47:20.934
uh?

1169
00:47:21.706 --> 00:47:23.307
mom

1170
00:47:23.374 --> 00:47:24.842
(Jaehwi) Your son is right.

1171
00:47:25.377 --> 00:47:27.000
(Nanjing) Have surgery, patient.

1172
00:47:27.067 --> 00:47:28.546
Please, really.

1173
00:47:29.177 --> 00:47:30.414
(temperature) I was wrong

1174
00:47:31.084 --> 00:47:33.150
I'm sorry, grandma, please

1175
00:47:38.525 --> 00:47:39.523
[sigh]

1176
00:47:40.811 --> 00:47:42.960
I had no intention of having surgery.

1177
00:47:43.761 --> 00:47:47.898
I feel bad that everyone fooled me.
I was going to go home right away

1178
00:47:55.943 --> 00:47:58.640
(Jaok) Because of the teacher here
I'll think again

1179
00:48:02.382 --> 00:48:03.844
Because I’m thankful

1180
00:48:03.911 --> 00:48:06.386
Ah, but that's really not a big deal.

1181
00:48:06.453 --> 00:48:08.119
For telling me honestly

1182
00:48:08.767 --> 00:48:10.510
[light music]

1183
00:48:10.577 --> 00:48:13.277
(Jaok) If it weren’t for the teacher
What kind of disease am I?

1184
00:48:13.344 --> 00:48:15.300
I don't even know what happens to my body

1185
00:48:15.367 --> 00:48:17.644
I almost got taken to the operating room.

1186
00:48:17.711 --> 00:48:20.431
Where in the world is such an idiot?

1187
00:48:23.811 --> 00:48:25.569
Thanks for talking to me.

1188
00:48:27.104 --> 00:48:29.573
The only person I can trust is my teacher.

1189
00:48:29.640 --> 00:48:31.734
I'm an old man who doesn't know anything

1190
00:48:31.801 --> 00:48:33.444
Would it have been easy to deceive?

1191
00:48:34.011 --> 00:48:35.210
(Namkyung) No...

1192
00:48:35.277 --> 00:48:36.414
(Jaehwi) I’m sorry

1193
00:48:37.251 --> 00:48:38.389
(Nanjing) I’m sorry

1194
00:48:39.143 --> 00:48:41.188
If you have surgery

1195
00:48:41.255 --> 00:48:42.865
Is the teacher coming too?

1196
00:48:48.225 --> 00:48:49.994
Yes, I will definitely go, Grandma.

1197
00:48:51.208 --> 00:48:52.563
[Embarrassed laughter]

1198
00:48:54.902 --> 00:48:56.236
(Jaehwi) Write...

1199
00:48:56.303 --> 00:48:57.537
Yes, then

1200
00:48:57.604 --> 00:48:59.437
(Mutual) Yes, over there, but

1201
00:49:00.440 --> 00:49:01.710
This is the consent form for surgery.

1202
00:49:01.777 --> 00:49:03.710
Ah, but why is the writing like this?

1203
00:49:03.777 --> 00:49:06.744
(Namkyung) Oh, it’s easier for you to see grandma.

1204
00:49:06.811 --> 00:49:08.546
I made the font bigger and selected it in advance.

1205
00:49:09.713 --> 00:49:11.318
Oh, I heard you’ve read it?

1206
00:49:11.385 --> 00:49:13.753
- My mother can’t read Korean.
- (Namkyung) Yes?

1207
00:49:13.820 --> 00:49:16.520
[humorous music]
(Mutual) I think I told you that once.

1208
00:49:16.587 --> 00:49:18.277
He just left it behind

1209
00:49:18.344 --> 00:49:19.493
(Namkyung) Ah...

1210
00:49:19.560 --> 00:49:20.591
(Mutual) I...

1211
00:49:21.187 --> 00:49:23.563
All I have to do is get mom's signature here, right?

1212
00:49:23.630 --> 00:49:25.562
Ah, that

1213
00:49:25.629 --> 00:49:28.031
No, I gave it to you so you can see it in advance.

1214
00:49:28.098 --> 00:49:31.577
When receiving your signature, please read it again carefully.

1215
00:49:31.644 --> 00:49:33.000
(Jaehwi) Let me explain.

1216
00:49:33.067 --> 00:49:35.406
(Mutual) Ah, yes, thank you.

1217
00:49:38.512 --> 00:49:40.110
[light sigh]
(Gion) Yes, I eat at home too.

1218
00:49:40.177 --> 00:49:41.477
(Ja-ok) Oh, my goodness

1219
00:49:41.544 --> 00:49:42.434
[Gion’s laughter]

1220
00:49:42.501 --> 00:49:43.847
(Namkyung) You’re going to be a bastard

1221
00:49:43.914 --> 00:49:45.952
[Keyboard operation sound]
You can just do anything that works

1222
00:49:46.019 --> 00:49:47.644
No matter what I do, it works out well

1223
00:49:47.711 --> 00:49:51.110
Ah, the timing
It can't be just like that, huh?

1224
00:49:51.177 --> 00:49:52.556
[happy laughter]
[Interesting music]

1225
00:49:53.724 --> 00:49:56.300
Hey, when you're on duty
There aren't any calls

1226
00:49:56.367 --> 00:49:58.443
Huh? In my case, it took all night.

1227
00:49:58.510 --> 00:50:00.998
Oh, if you're going to get annoyed, just go home.

1228
00:50:01.065 --> 00:50:03.277
If you're not going, you can stand on duty instead of me.

1229
00:50:03.344 --> 00:50:05.000
(Namkyung) Ha, because of emergency surgery.

1230
00:50:05.067 --> 00:50:08.742
Professor Jaehwi Ryu’s two surgeries were delayed.
I can't go now!

1231
00:50:08.809 --> 00:50:11.809
Those who can't do it must be really tired.

1232
00:50:12.334 --> 00:50:13.844
This is Mr.
[happy laughter]

1233
00:50:16.884 --> 00:50:18.693
Oh, Mr. Hwak!

1234
00:50:32.622 --> 00:50:33.798
[light sigh]

1235
00:50:34.801 --> 00:50:36.644
[Sound of door opening]

1236
00:50:36.711 --> 00:50:39.133
(Jeongmin) I, Jin Jin-hyo, am going into labor.

1237
00:50:39.200 --> 00:50:41.405
I'm doing a good job checking the ward and emergency room.

1238
00:50:41.472 --> 00:50:42.314
yes

1239
00:50:42.381 --> 00:50:44.388
[telephone ringing sound]

1240
00:50:45.112 --> 00:50:46.377
Yes, this is an obstetrics and gynecology department.

1241
00:50:49.246 --> 00:50:50.781
Oh, yes, I'll be right there.

1242
00:50:51.767 --> 00:50:52.850
[Sound of putting down receiver]

1243
00:50:55.522 --> 00:50:58.177
(Junseok) Not a mother at our hospital.
My water has already broken.

1244
00:51:00.827 --> 00:51:01.692
[Ultrasound machine operating sound]

1245
00:51:02.996 --> 00:51:04.094
maternal body

1246
00:51:07.011 --> 00:51:09.600
Your Amniotic Membrane Ruptured

1247
00:51:10.501 --> 00:51:12.837
So, water break, you no?

1248
00:51:14.007 --> 00:51:15.243
[Lee Young’s embarrassed exclamation]

1249
00:51:15.310 --> 00:51:16.573
What’s Your Name?

1250
00:51:16.640 --> 00:51:20.410
[Russian]

1251
00:51:22.078 --> 00:51:23.147
[Korean] What do you mean?

1252
00:51:24.481 --> 00:51:26.810
Name, name, name

1253
00:51:26.877 --> 00:51:27.834
